  lines:
  - speaker: 1
    text: I will pretend not to have seen. Neither of us wants to end up in the depths
      of the temple dungeon.
  - speaker: 0
    text: Is this thing that dangerous?
  - speaker: 1
    text: Not dangerous in itself, but some would be ready to do anything to get
      their hands on it... really everything.
  - speaker: 0
    text: What kind of person?
  - speaker: 1
    text: "Some questions don\u2019t arise. Not in these lands especially."
